[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0010","text":"……呼\n稍微休息一下吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0020","text":"咦，那边的是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0030","text":"喂，果穗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0033","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0040","text":"树里酱！你好\n在慢跑吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0050","text":"嗯\n白天跑步的话，有点太累了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0060","text":"也是呢……！\n不过，现在也很热……要多喝水哦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0070","text":"啊哈哈，说得对\n好，那就在这里喝点饮料休息一下吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0080","text":"──果穗也一起来怎么样？\n我请你喝点什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0090","text":"诶！？\n让您请客，不太好吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0100","text":"不不，你陪着我休息嘛！\n来，去自动贩卖机吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100300_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
